===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|crab-apple}}, {{l|en|crab apple}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|crab|apple|id1=apple|t1=wild apple}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɹæbˌæpəl/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Wodencafe-crabapple.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of the wild species of [[apple]] tree, genus ''[[Malus]]'', which generally yield small, bitter fruit (in comparison to domestic apples, {{taxfmt|Malus domestica|species}}).
#: {{syn|en|crab|crab tree|crabapple tree}}
# The fruit of this tree.
#: {{syn|en|crab}}
# An unpleasant person; a person who is [[crabby]].
#: {{syn|en|grouch|grump|misery|moaner}}

